Cognate with {{cog|dum|wallen|t=to boil, bubble}}, {{cog|nl|wellen|t=to weld}}, {{cog|de|wellen|t=to wave, warp}}, {{cog|da|vælde|t=to overwhelm}}, {{cog|sv|välla|t=to gush, weld}}. See also {{l|en|well}}.

